    {
      "ESSeqNum": 0,
      "FacilityID": 1000124088,
      "SummaryText": "EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\n\nThe accidental release prevention and emergency response policies:  To insure safe operation and release prevention, the REG Geismar, LLC facility has implemented The Occupational Safety and Health Administrations (OSHA) Chemical Process Safety Management Program 29 CFR 1910.119 standard.  All operators of the facility undergo Chemical Process Safety Management (PSM) training and operator training specific to the facility.  The Propane storage System complies with NFPA-58 requirements for LP-Gas storage, and it is our policy to adhere to all applicable federal, state, and local laws.  If an emergency were to occur, it is our policy to notify the Ascension Parish Fire and State Police Departments and request that they respond to the emergency.    \n \nA description of your facility and the regulated substances handled:  This facility produces Renewable Hydrocarbon Diesel Fuel.  LPG is a co-product for sale to retail propane outlets."
    }
